                                "sense_id": "067ed41e-bad3-3c3a-9da9-fc128f2ea319",
                                "text": "She led Dr Grimsby out to the workshop, where Peter was at work on the marquetry table. He had the two veneers clamped together and was cutting the inlay pattern with the finest of fretsaws."
                            }
                        ]
